'''Infected''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 2nd tier in the Zombies Rewards during the [[Halloween Event 2022|2022 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==

It resembles the appearance of the [[Default Knife]], but with a light green zombie skin infecting half of it, hence the name.
==Trivia==
*It has a [[Infected Gun (2022)|partner gun]] under the same name.
* Only players that joined the Zombies team were able to obtain this through a tier. However, if players joined the Surivors team instead, they could only purchase the [[Apocalypse (Knife)|Apocalypse]] knife through the same tier.

